This is a list of Pokémon in the order dictated by the [[event]] [[regional Pokédex|Pokédex]] in  [[Pokémon Pokopia]]. The Pokémon in this Pokédex are only found during limited-time events, which can be triggered on certain days. There are at least 7 numbered Pokémon in the Event Pokédex, with additions possible in future events. The Event Pokédex is distinct from the [[List of Pokémon by Pokédex number in Pokémon Pokopia|regular Pokédex]] that has most of the Pokémon found in the game story. The '''Cloud Island Pokédex (Event)''' filled out when visiting Cloud Islands follows an identical list to the Event Pokédex used in the main game.

